Adventurer,

A new *Dev Talk* has arrived! In this video Game Director Robin Henkys give=
s an update on the development of some major changes coming to the game, in=
cluding an update to the *Roads of Avalon* , a huge new feature called the =
*Mists* , and more.

Click the video below to watch his talk:

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DHKS-6vuo7SA )

Prefer a written summary? Then click *here* ( https://albiononline.com/news=
/development-update-sep-2022 ).

The Priest Vanity Bundle is Here
--------------------------------

The new *Priest Vanity Bundle* ( https://albiononline.com/news/priest-vanit=
y ) is here! This premiere bundle is available in the ingame store, and inc=
ludes a full *costume set* plus a matching *Ethereal Horse Mount Skin* for =
your *Riding Horse* base mount.

The Priest Bundle includes the following vanity skins, which work on male a=
nd female characters alike:

* *Priest's Hood*
* *Priest's Robe*
* *Priest's Boots*
* *Priest's Cape*
* *Ethereal Horse* (Requires any Riding Horse base mount)

Get this premiere bundle today and bring light to the lands of Albion!

( https://albiononline.com/news/heretic-challenge-2022 )

Take the Heretic Challenge
--------------------------

Fall has reached Albion, and the *Heretic Challenge* ( https://albiononline=
.com/news/heretic-challenge-2022 ) is upon us! Until the end of September y=
ou can earn points for open-world activities, unlock chests to get valuable=
 loot, and claim your very own *Heretic Combat Mule*. Read more here:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/heretic-challenge-2022 )

